BossQuickDock
Developed by RamalhoBoss.

Modified version of HearBridge PS5 (https://github.com/X-F1REBALL-X/HearBridge-PS5),
Copyright (c) 2026 X-F1REBALL-X. All credit for the original work goes to him.

Changes by RamalhoBoss (2026-10-20): new name, icon, tile and web UI; USB
Bluetooth transport that never cancels transfers, so a DualSense reconnects
while audio plays; replay of system HCI replies; log size cap, logs off in
the release build.

Changes by RamalhoBoss (2026-10-23, 1.1.0): aptX codec (opt-in), low
battery notification on the console, PS5 Payload SDK v0.45, CI.

Changes by RamalhoBoss (2026-10-24, 1.1.1): a new link the system stack
hangs up on while we page it is paged again (2 s pause, not 45 s).

